  "worked_solution": "For any two finite sets $K$ and $M,$ the cardinality of $K\\times M$ is\n\n$$\n|K\\times M|=|K|\\cdot |M|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|K\\times M| & =|K|\\cdot |M| \\\\  & =5\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
